 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, my folder was ten gigabytes.",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 2.12,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Zipped, it's two.",
   "s": 2.18,
   "e": 3.48,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Where did the other eight go?",
   "s": 3.54,
   "e": 4.99,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nowhere. It was mostly repeating itself.",
   "s": 5.32,
   "e": 7.75,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Repeating how?",
   "s": 8.02,
   "e": 9.07,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Take la,",
   "s": 9.32,
   "e": 10.26,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "la, la,",
   "s": 10.32,
   "e": 10.64,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "la, la.",
   "s": 10.7,
   "e": 11.39,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Or just write: la,",
   "s": 11.6,
   "e": 13.26,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "six times.",
   "s": 13.32,
   "e": 14.28,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Same song,",
   "s": 14.34,
   "e": 14.96,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "fewer letters.",
   "s": 15.02,
   "e": 15.89,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "And nothing lost.",
   "s": 16.2,
   "e": 17.43,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Unzip it,",
   "s": 17.76,
   "e": 18.28,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and every la comes back.",
   "s": 18.34,
   "e": 20.33,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "But my photos aren't la,",
   "s": 20.4,
   "e": 21.76,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "la, la.",
   "s": 21.82,
   "e": 22.45,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "No. So photos get something sneakier.",
   "s": 22.86,
   "e": 25.93,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "They throw things away.",
   "s": 26.16,
   "e": 27.63,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Throw away?",
   "s": 27.96,
   "e": 29.05,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Parts of my picture?",
   "s": 29.38,
   "e": 30.65,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only what your eyes miss.",
   "s": 30.82,
   "e": 32.45,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You see brightness sharply,",
   "s": 32.92,
   "e": 34.41,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "color blurrily.",
   "s": 34.52,
   "e": 35.89,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it keeps the sharp part,",
   "s": 36.2,
   "e": 37.3,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and blurs the color.",
   "s": 37.36,
   "e": 39.03,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And songs?",
   "s": 39.28,
   "e": 40.21,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A loud drum hides the",
   "s": 40.38,
   "e": 41.92,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "quiet sounds beside it.",
   "s": 41.98,
   "e": 43.65,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You never hear them.",
   "s": 43.86,
   "e": 45.05,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "MP3 deletes them.",
   "s": 45.36,
   "e": 47.01,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It deletes what I can't hear?",
   "s": 47.08,
   "e": 48.89,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten times smaller,",
   "s": 49.08,
   "e": 50.02,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and you don't notice.",
   "s": 50.08,
   "e": 51.53,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. So it's never",
   "s": 51.86,
   "e": 53.02,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "the real song?",
   "s": 53.08,
   "e": 54.23,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Close enough.",
   "s": 54.48,
   "e": 55.41,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Save it again and again,",
   "s": 55.72,
   "e": 56.96,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and you get a",
   "s": 57.02,
   "e": 57.84,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "photocopy of a photocopy.",
   "s": 57.9,
   "e": 59.88,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So I zip the zip,",
   "s": 59.94,
   "e": 61.44,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "till the whole movie",
   "s": 61.5,
   "e": 62.46,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "is one byte!",
   "s": 62.52,
   "e": 63.77,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Try it.",
   "s": 64.22,
   "e": 65.37,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A packed suitcase doesn't shrink",
   "s": 65.58,
   "e": 67.1,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "when you sit on it.",
   "s": 67.16,
   "e": 68.37,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
